{
  "method": "On each signal date select among fixed subsets of the actual PSE bullish label or the previous bearish fund momentum/contrarian candidate, using the prior 36 months' reconstructed calls whose outcomes completed strictly before the signal. Require >=30 calls, >=6 months, >=8 symbols, >=51% correct and >=1 percentage point over that prior baseline's accuracy in the same historical window, otherwise abstain. Select highest historical hit rate, tie-break by coverage and fixed order. PSE label uses app classifier and 90-day window; funds use Yahoo 3-month window and require six- and twelve-month history. Peer returns use previous local dates. First monthly close to first close on or after three calendar months within ten days; ties are misses. Test 2020-2026. Comparisons use same eligible population; selected calls differ.",
  "limitations": [
    "Exploratory historical research after repeatedly examining these years. No untouched or prospective evaluation; multiple variants and research selection undermine naive confidence intervals.",
    "Prior local-date peer closes may not have been available at signal time. Present-day listings and outcome-availability filtering cause survivorship and selection bias; missing and pending outcomes are not scored.",
    "Overlapping horizons and market shocks make observations correlated. Raw prices may be revised; same-close execution, dividends, fees, taxes and slippage are not modeled. Funds include other ETPs. Not deployed."
  ],
